Native Bun and Node loopback controls run this fixture with `BUN_WASM_NATIVE_CONTROL=1`, which selects the native HTTP transport for the streaming case. The compiled guest selects bun-wasm's fetch-backed HTTPS adapter by supplying an `href` with a loopback HTTP URL, avoiding a private TLS trust override. Expected output is maintained manually because native `https.request` does not use that adapter-specific `href` selection.
